@page "/docs"
@inject Registry Registry
@inject ApiMetadata Api

<PageTitle>Docs · IzzyBlazor</PageTitle>
<HeadContent><meta name="description" content="IzzyBlazor's documentation: SSR-first Blazor components, their API, style props and demos." /></HeadContent>

<article class="site-article">
    <Stack Gap="3" Class="site-pagehead">
        <Heading Level="1" Size="TextSize.Xl3">Documentation</Heading>
        <TextBlock Size="TextSize.Lg" Color="Color.Muted">
            IzzyBlazor @Api.Version: Blazor components built for static SSR. Pages arrive as real HTML, a small script
            brings them to life without a circuit, and the same markup binds to C# on interactive pages. Every example on
            this site runs all three ways, so you can see what each layer adds.
        </TextBlock>
    </Stack>

    <Heading Level="2">Off · Static · Live</Heading>
    <Prose>
        <p>Each example has a switch for the three ways a page can run:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Off</strong>: JavaScript disabled. The frame is sandboxed without script, so you see exactly what the HTML and CSS do on their own.</li>
            <li><strong>Static</strong>: a static SSR page with IzzyBlazor's script, which adds keyboard handling, live values and the like. No circuit.</li>
            <li><strong>Live</strong>: an interactive page on Blazor Server, where C# event handlers and <code>@@bind</code> run.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Component pages show the same thing as a table: what works in each mode, feature by feature.</p>
    </Prose>

    <Heading Level="2">Where to go</Heading>
    <Grid Columns="new() { Base = 1, Sm = 2, Lg = 3 }" Gap="3">
        <Card Title="Components" Href="docs/components" Description="@($"{Registry.ComponentCountLabel}, by category, each with an Overview and an API page.")" Size="ControlSize.Sm" Class="site-linkcard">
            <CardHeader><Pictogram Icon="Lucide.LayoutGrid" /></CardHeader>
        </Card>
        <Card Title="Style props" Href="docs/common/style-props" Description="The item, surface and field props many components share." Size="ControlSize.Sm" Class="site-linkcard">
            <CardHeader><Pictogram Icon="Lucide.Ruler" /></CardHeader>
        </Card>
        <Card Title="Demos" Href="demos" Description="Realistic scenarios in all three modes, with the source." Size="ControlSize.Sm" Class="site-linkcard">
            <CardHeader><Pictogram Icon="Lucide.MonitorPlay" /></CardHeader>
        </Card>
        <Card Title="Getting started" Href="https://github.com/enabledevmode/izzyblazor/blob/main/docs/getting-started.md" Description="Install the package, add IzzyTheme and map the endpoints." Size="ControlSize.Sm" Class="site-linkcard">
            <CardHeader><Pictogram Icon="Lucide.Rocket" /></CardHeader>
        </Card>
        <Card Title="Styling and themes" Href="https://github.com/enabledevmode/izzyblazor/blob/main/docs/styling.md" Description="Presets, brand colors, tokens, color schemes and customizing." Size="ControlSize.Sm" Class="site-linkcard">
            <CardHeader><Pictogram Icon="Lucide.Palette" /></CardHeader>
        </Card>
        <Card Title="API metadata" Href="izzyblazor.api.json" Description="Every component's API as JSON, for tools and AI assistants." Size="ControlSize.Sm" Class="site-linkcard">
            <CardHeader><Pictogram Icon="Lucide.Braces" /></CardHeader>
        </Card>
    </Grid>
</article>
